#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:36
msgid "Original author, long time maintainer, design and lots of code."
msgstr ""
"Orginaalschriever, lange Tiet de Pleger, Utsehn un en helen Barg vun Kode"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:39
msgid "Maurizio Paolini"
msgstr "Maurizio Paolini"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:40
msgid ""
"Did a lot of important work all around Kig, including, but not limited to "
"conics, cubics, transformations and property tests support."
msgstr ""
"Hett wichtige Arbeiden rund Kig kloor maakt, ok, man nich bloots, Kegelsneed, "
"kubsch Funkschonen, Ümformen un Ünnerstütten för Egenschappen-Proven."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:45
msgid "Pino Toscano"
msgstr "Pino Toscano"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:46
msgid ""
"Actual maintainer, Dr. Geo import filter, point and line styles, Italian "
"translation, miscellaneous stuff here and there."
msgstr ""
"Pleger opstunns, Importfilter för \"Dr. Geo\", Punkt- un Lienstilen, "
"italieensch Översetten, un sprangwies noch anner Saken."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:51
msgid "Franco Pasquarelli"
msgstr "Franco Pasquarelli"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:52
msgid ""
"Helped a lot with the implementation of the Locus object, there's quite some "
"math involved in doing it right, and Franco wrote the most difficult parts."
msgstr ""
"Hülp bi't Ümsetten vun't \"Locus\"-Objekt, wo recht en beten wat Mathematik "
"för bruukt warrt; Franco hett dor de swoorst Delen vun schreven."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:57
msgid "Francesca Gatti"
msgstr "Francesca Gatti"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:58
msgid "Responsible for the computation of the algebraic equation of a locus."
msgstr ""
"Dreegt de Verantwoorden för't Utreken vun algebraasch Glieken för en "
"geometersch Oort."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kig/aboutdata.h:62
